#
# Trivy misconfiguration suppressions for this repository.
# Local scan: trivy fs --severity HIGH,CRITICAL --scanners misconfig,vuln \
#   --config .github/scan_tools_configs/trivy.yml --ignorefile .trivyignore .
#
# .trivyignore entries are matched by AVD ID repo-wide (not path-scoped);
# trivy's path-scoped .trivyignore.yaml is not yet wired into the shared
# ROCm/rocm-security-gh workflow this repo uses, so each entry below lists
# every affected manifest in its comment rather than being auto-scoped.

# KSV-0041 (CRITICAL): ClusterRole 'manager-role' shouldn't manage 'secrets'.
# Covers config/rbac/role.yaml and config/rbac-hub/role.yaml. The operator
# needs cluster-wide secret access to read pull secrets referenced by Module
# specs across namespaces; narrowing this is a real RBAC redesign (functional
# change), tracked as a follow-up rather than done here.
AVD-KSV-0041

# KSV-0014 (HIGH): Container should set securityContext.readOnlyRootFilesystem.
# Covers the manager and webhook-server Deployments (config/manager-base/
# manager.yaml, config/manager-base/manager_config_patch.yaml,
# config/manager/manager_worker_image_patch.yaml,
# config/webhook-server/deployment.yaml). Setting this requires auditing
# every write path in those binaries first; functional change, follow-up.
AVD-KSV-0014

# KSV-0118 (HIGH): Container/deployment is using the default security context.
# Same Deployments as AVD-KSV-0014 above; follows from the same follow-up.
AVD-KSV-0118
